	If you're on a multi-user cluster where people can access each
other's bones files, you can do a nice sophomoric trick. You name your
fruit "war hammer named Mjollnir" and make sure that you keep exactly
one of them on you at all times. Then wait around till someone gets one
of your bones piles and goes wild at finding a "named weapon" on a bones
level. See how long it takes them to figure out why it shows up in
"Comestibles" in their inventory, and why the "war hammer" is not doing
much damage to anything.

